 	// REWINDBOX_PPU_WAIT_FLOOR_943 (ios/IOSPpuWaitFloor943.h).
-	GAME_SETTING("experimental.ppu_wait_floor", "Experimental", "PPU", "PPU short wait floor", "When a PPU thread polls with the same short timed wait again and again (the same system call, object and timeout under 200 us: sys_timer_usleep, or the timeout of a semaphore, condition variable, event queue or mutex) and the previous one ran to its end, the next one waits four times as long, at most 200 us, before it times out; a wait that is signalled still ends at once. An lv2 timeout is a minimum, so this is correct on the console too: the loop checks its flag a little later and makes up to four times fewer rounds of the PPU scheduler. Automatic: Call of Duty: Black Ops II. Enabled: every game. Disabled: none, as before Core 943. Takes effect on the next boot.", kind::RPCS3_IOS_SETTING_CHOICE, g_cfg.ios_experimental.ppu_wait_floor, 0, 0, 0),
